WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.750
Try counting every snail in a wood.

2
00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:08.070
They hide, they move, and every step
you take tramples their habitat.

3
00:00:08.120 --> 00:00:11.630
Counting every individual
is usually impossible.

4
00:00:11.680 --> 00:00:14.350
And you'd never be sure
you'd found the last one.

5
00:00:14.400 --> 00:00:17.720
So how can you know how many
snails live in a whole wood,

6
00:00:17.770 --> 00:00:20.260
without finding every single one?

7
00:00:20.310 --> 00:00:23.520
In this mission, you'll
follow a line up a salt marsh,

8
00:00:23.570 --> 00:00:27.110
and watch one plant
appear, peak and vanish.

9
00:00:27.160 --> 00:00:32.060
Then you'll face a hard question: does
a pattern along a line prove what caused

10
00:00:32.110 --> 00:00:32.900
it?

11
00:00:32.950 --> 00:00:37.820
Your mission: find out how to work out
the size of a whole population without

12
00:00:37.870 --> 00:00:39.390
counting every one of them.
